.TH CBMAP_REMOVE 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cbmap_remove \- remove a key-value pair (type-safe)
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cbstmap.h>

ccol_retval_t cbmap_remove(hm_name, key);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Type-safe wrapper for cbmap_delete_elem() that returns the result code.
Tree is automatically rebalanced after deletion.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
hm_name  BST map to remove from
key      Key to remove
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
Returns ccol_success if removed
Returns ccol_key_not_found if not found
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Does not terminate on key_not_found
Frees memory for key and value
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cbmap_delete_elem (3),
.BR cbmap_insert (3)
